  "content": "[Intro]\n[B]  [D#m]\n[E]  [F#7]\n[B]  [D#]\n[E]  [F#7]\n\n[Verse]\n[B/F#]There's a place where\n[D#]lovers go To\n[E]cry their [F#]troubles a-\n[B/F#]way\n[E]And they call it\n[B]Lonesome [Abm]Town\n[E]Where the [F#7]broken hearts\n[B/F#]stay\n\n[Verse 2]\n[B/F#]You can buy a\n[D#]dream or two\n[E]To last you [F#]all through the\n[B/F#]years\n[E]And the only\n[B]price you [Abm]pay\n[E]Is a [F#7]heart full of\n[B/F#]tears\n\n[Verse 3]\n[E]Goin' down to\n[D#m]Lonesome Town\n[E]Where the [F#]broken hearts\n[B/F#]stay\n[E]Goin' down to\n[D#m]Lonesome Town To\n[C#]cry my troubles a-\n[F#7]way\n\n[Verse 4]\n[B]In the town of\n[D#]broken dreams\n[E]The streets are [F#7]filled with re-\n[B/F#]gret\n[E]Maybe down in\n[B]Lonesome [Abm]Town\n[E]I can [F#7]learn to for-\n[B/F#]get\n\n[Outro]\n[E]Maybe [Em]down in\n[B]Lonesome [Abm]Town\n[E]I can [F#7]learn to for-\n[B]get [E/B]\n[B/F#]",
